mac-mini's question -- p0 scaling vs translation invariance:
  p0([0..7])      = 0.3272
  p0(2*[0..7])    = 0.3272   (DILATION: equal => scaling-invariant)
  p0([1..8])        = 0.4162   (TRANSLATION by 1)
  p0([2..9])      = 0.3603   (TRANSLATION by 2)
